# HakiOS fragment: the Google Pixel 10 (frankel, devices/frankel) -- what is true of this phone and of no other with the same SoC.
# Every driver of the common repository is another phone's (Qualcomm's and Samsung's blocks at their addresses) or a virtual
# machine's: all are left out, and with them the arguments only they read. No firmware is pulled from the phone. The first boot
# (docs/porting/index.md, step 2): the boot loader's framebuffer through the shim and the loader, the root in RAM, to launchd.
CONFIG_DEVICE="frankel"
CONFIG_FIRMWARE="none"
# No storage: the loader's block service is UEFI's, and the shim (socs/lga/shim) offers none; Google's UFS host (0x3C400000) is a
# driver still to write (README.md, "Next steps"). The root is the payload's, in RAM.
# CONFIG_UFS is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_ADSP is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_SPEAKER is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_GUARD is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_SOUND is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_MIC is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_MAX98512 is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_EXYNOS_ABOX is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BT is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BCM4361_BT is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_CAMERA is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_TORCH is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_S2MPB02_TORCH is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_SOCINFO is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_EXYNOS_HSI2C is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_EXYNOS_ACPM is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_ADRENO is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_MALI is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_S6E3HA8 is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_HAPTIC is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_GOODIX is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BUTTONS is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_EXYNOS_KEYS is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_S6SY761 is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_QMI is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_MODEM is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BATTERY is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_CPUFREQ is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_THERMAL is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_PMIC is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BATTGUARD is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_MAX77705 is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_UFS is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_WIFI is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_WIFI_STA is not set
# CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN is not set
# CONFIG_GPU is not set
# CONFIG_ADSP is not set
# CONFIG_SOUND is not set
# CONFIG_WIFI is not set
# CONFIG_MODEM is not set
# CONFIG_MODEM_AGAIN is not set
# QEMU's virtio devices: not on a phone (and the network one needs the Wi-Fi driver's station layer, hakios.sta.c, left out above)
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_VIRTIO_INPUT is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_VIRTIO_SOUND is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_VIRTIO_NET is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_VIRTIO_BLK is not set
